{"reviewId": "231510692_85kC44QG8", "review": {"abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "简单解释一下：打个比方，资源品就比如白银，常年低价导致白银的生产投入每年只能产出10个，当突发事件（上文资本投入加大或新国家需求增加）出现，由于需求每年涨到50个，但生产因常年低迷仍然只能供应10个（文中所谓的资源生产的约束限制），所以此时需求极大的大于供给（短期内供需关系不平衡），就会出现价高者得的类似拍卖的现象导致整个市场价格乱套", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4566-4660", "createTime": 1765499796, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "231510692_85kC44QG8", "userVid": 231510692, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 231510692, "name": "杨大侠", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/lpR8ysAEwLXzB2xDicjE4AdNw629wmI4njptNQzwO4BAJOZg4J6flG7VpicvSOUzV6oodznwkPJtia18Mic2ZcbWq0IXLga6LmIVvvnkrpA7tnY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 63, "likes": [{"userVid": 231510692, "name": "杨大侠", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/lpR8ysAEwLXzB2xDicjE4AdNw629wmI4njptNQzwO4BAJOZg4J6flG7VpicvSOUzV6oodznwkPJtia18Mic2ZcbWq0IXLga6LmIVvvnkrpA7tnY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员",